[00:21.17] Please don't get answers from eyes
[00:26.67] You know that mine can't lie
[00:30.14] Quite as well as yours
[00:34.97] Just let the spare moment flow
[00:40.67] Rounding steps as I go
[00:44.18] Through the open doors
[00:47.34] 
[01:03.23] Please don't deflate from a sigh
[01:08.83] I'd hold still every time but I'd start to shake
[01:13.45] 
[01:17.18] I wander around for days
[01:22.86] Wondering what I'll say
[01:26.42] When they want the truth
[01:30.48] 
[01:44.87] You will never know how hard I try
[01:52.22] To keep from waning while waiting at the start
[01:58.66] The depth of every touch is real as you need
[02:05.30] But words don't do any favours for me
[02:13.30] 
